,serif;\\">The function&nbsp;<span class=\\"mq-math-mode\\" latex-data=\\"f\\"><span class=\\"mq-textarea\\"><textarea autocapitalize=\\"off\\" autocomplete=\\"off\\" autocorrect=\\"off\\" spellcheck=\\"false\\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\\"true\\" data-cke-editable=\\"1\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></textarea></span><span class=\\"mq-root-block\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"1\\"><var class=\\"mq-f\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"41\\">f</var></span></span>&nbsp;is defined by <span class=\\"mq-math-mode\\" latex-data=\\"f(x)=24x^3\\"><span class=\\"mq-textarea\\"><textarea autocapitalize=\\"off\\" autocomplete=\\"off\\" autocorrect=\\"off\\" spellcheck=\\"false\\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\\"true\\" data-cke-editable=\\"1\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></textarea></span><span class=\\"mq-root-block\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"1\\"><var class=\\"mq-f\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"3\\">f</var><span mathquill-command-id=\\"5\\">(</span><var mathquill-command-id=\\"7\\">x</var><span mathquill-command-id=\\"9\\">)</span><span class=\\"mq-binary-operator\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"11\\">=</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"13\\">2</span><span mathquill-command-id=\\"15\\">4</span><var mathquill-command-id=\\"17\\">x</var><span class=\\"mq-supsub mq-non-leaf mq-sup-only\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"19\\"><span class=\\"mq-sup\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"21\\"><span mathquill-command-id=\\"20\\">3</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;. The graph of <span class=\\"mq-math-mode\\" latex-data=\\"y=f(-x)+c\\"><span class=\\"mq-textarea\\"><textarea autocapitalize=\\"off\\" autocomplete=\\"off\\" autocorrect=\\"off\\" spellcheck=\\"false\\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\\"true\\" data-cke-editable=\\"1\\" contenteditable=\\"false\\"></textarea></span><span class=\\"mq-root-block\\" mathquill-block-id=\\"1\\"><var mathquill-command-id=\\"23\\">y</var><span class=\\"mq-binary-operator\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"25\\">=</span><var class=\\"mq-f\\" mathquill-command-id=\\"27\\">f</var><span mathquill-command